  user_input {
    user_response: "Build a gym management web application called \"Corenix Club Software\" for internal gym staff use only. \n\nDesign system:\n- Dark theme: background #0D0D0D, card surface #161616, borders #222222\n- Primary accent: #E8192C (Corenix red), secondary text #888888\n- Font: Use \'Barlow\' from Google Fonts for headings, \'Inter\' for body text\n- All amounts in Indian Rupee (\342\202\271)\n- Language: English with some Hindi labels where shown\n\nCreate a full responsive sidebar layout with:\n- Left sidebar (240px wide, collapsible) with the Corenix logo text at top\n- Navigation items with icons: Dashboard, Members, Attendance, Staff, Trainers, Reports, Offers, Measurements, Reviews, Settings\n- Active state: red left border + red icon\n- Main content area with a topbar showing: today\'s date, a search bar, and a notification bell icon\n- Footer: \"Corenix Club Software | Powered by Fit United\"\n\nUse vanilla HTML, CSS, JavaScript. Make it a single-page application (SPA) where clicking nav items shows/hides sections. Start by showing the Dashboard section."
    items {
      text: "Build a gym management web application called \"Corenix Club Software\" for internal gym staff use only. \n\nDesign system:\n- Dark theme: background #0D0D0D, card surface #161616, borders #222222\n- Primary accent: #E8192C (Corenix red), secondary text #888888\n- Font: Use \'Barlow\' from Google Fonts for headings, \'Inter\' for body text\n- All amounts in Indian Rupee (\342\202\271)\n- Language: English with some Hindi labels where shown\n\nCreate a full responsive sidebar layout with:\n- Left sidebar (240px wide, collapsible) with the Corenix logo text at top\n- Navigation items with icons: Dashboard, Members, Attendance, Staff, Trainers, Reports, Offers, Measurements, Reviews, Settings\n- Active state: red left border + red icon\n- Main content area with a topbar showing: today\'s date, a search bar, and a notification bell icon\n- Footer: \"Corenix Club Software | Powered by Fit United\"\n\nUse vanilla HTML, CSS, JavaScript. Make it a single-page application (SPA) where clicking nav items shows/hides sections. Start by showing the Dashboard section."
    }
  }
}
