  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Initial Build**\n\nI\'ve got the initial build compiled and the Single Page Application is ready. Now, I\'m verifying the final details. I have the \"Corenix Club Software for internal gym staff use only\" notice and the left sidebar with the Corenix logo text at the top implemented. I\'m focusing on the dashboard, members, attendance, and staff sections.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I\'ve successfully set up the **Corenix Club Software** using React to provide a fast Single-Page Application (SPA) experience while adhering entirely to your design system and specifications.\n\nHere is an overview of the key features implemented:\n- **Design System:** Applied the exact dark theme requested (background `#0D0D0D`, cards `#161616`, borders `#222222`) alongside the Corenix Red `(#E8192C)` accent color. \n- **Typography:** Configured Next.js to use Google Fonts **Barlow** for headlines and **Inter** for clean, readable body text.\n- **Sidebar Navigation:** Developed a collapsible side navigation loaded with Lucide icons that map out all your requested modules (Members, Attendance, Offers, etc.) and highlight active states effectively. \n- **Top Bar:** Constructed the robust top bar including today\342\200\231s generated date, a global search input field, and a notification bell. \n- **Interactive Dashboard:** Seeded the Dashboard view with representative data widgets (Total Members, Active Members, recent attendance feed), styled dynamically with INR amounts (\342\202\271) and clean metrics panels.\n\nOther navigation tabs will display an *under construction* placeholder since this initial step focuses on laying out the skeleton architecture. Please let me know which module (like Members, Offers, or Measurements) you would like me to build out next!"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 344311953
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
