isplay logic for data-rich representation. I\'m focusing on incorporating the `Award` icon, and the `hover:bg-[#0D0D0D]/50 transition-colors` attribute.\n\n\n**Integrating Top Members**\n\nI\'m now integrating the top paying members table. I\'ve designed a responsive table, including member names and Lifetime Value (LTV), and styled it for visual clarity. I\'ve also incorporated the `hover:bg-[#0D0D0D]/50 transition-colors` attribute, focusing on responsive design, data presentation, and visual appeal.\n\n\n**Adding Inactive Members**\n\nI\'m now integrating an inactive members section, with an inactive >30 days table, using a table layout and focusing on data display, with `Clock` icons and incorporating conditional display logic for data-rich representation. I\'m prioritizing styling for visual clarity using the `hover:bg-[#0D0D0D]/50 transition-colors` attribute. I\'m making sure to import `ChartJS` correctly.\n\n\n"
