    items {
      text: "Add these finishing touches to the Corenix app:\n\n1. NOTIFICATION SYSTEM:\n   - Bell icon in topbar shows count of pending notifications\n   - Dropdown shows: Members expiring today (red), Birthdays today (blue), Members with 0 visits this week, Staff absent today\n   - Each notification has a quick action button\n\n2. GLOBAL SEARCH:\n   - Search bar in topbar searches across: Members, Staff, Transactions\n   - Show results in a dropdown categorized by type\n\n3. SETTINGS SECTION:\n   - Gym Name, Address, Phone, Logo upload\n   - Membership plan pricing editor (owner can change prices)\n   - WhatsApp number for broadcasts\n   - Working hours setting\n   - Admin password change\n\n4. RECEIPT GENERATOR:\n   - When \"Generate Receipt\" is clicked on any member, show a printable receipt with:\n   - Corenix logo, gym address, receipt number, member name, plan, amount, payment mode, dates, thank you message\n   - Print button\n\n5. FINAL UI POLISH:\n   - Add smooth page transitions between sections (fade in/out)\n   - Add loading spinner on data operations\n   - Add confirmation dialogs before any delete action\n   - Make sure all tables are scrollable on mobile\n   - Add a \"dark/light mode\" toggle in the topbar\n   - Add Corenix branding: header gradient with subtle red glow on dashboard\n\nMake sure the final app feels premium and professional - worthy of the Corenix brand identity."
    }
  }
}
