  planner_response {
    modified_response: "All the requested finishing touches and polish are now fully integrated into the Corenix App!\n\nHere\'s what has been added:\n\n1. **Notification System (Top Bar)**:\n   - Added a `Bell` icon in the header with an animated pulsing counter.\n   - Clicking on it opens a beautifully categorised dropdown containing: Expiring Memberships (Red), Birthdays (Blue), Absentee lists (Orange), and Staff Absent alerts (Gray).\n   - Quick action buttons (like \"Send Reminders\", \"Send Offers\") are embedded within notifications to let the owner take instant action.\n\n2. **Global Search Engine**:\n   - Upgraded the topbar search input. Typing into it instantly filters \"globally\".\n   - Added a sophisticated dropdown visualization for search results, grouped neatly by categories such as **Members** and **Transactions**.\n\n3. **Master Settings View**:\n   - Hooked up the \"Settings\" tab in the main navigation.\n   - Designed an exhaustive control panel allowing Corenix owners to configure: General Gym Infos & logo uploads, Subscription Costing, Business Operation Hours, WhatsApp bulk communication triggers, and Admin System Passwords.\n\n4. **Receipt Generation & Printer Dialog**:\n   - Added a **\"Generate Receipt\" (Printer icon)** button directly in the member operations action list inside the `MembersView`.\n   - Clicking it generates a full-page, professionally templated receipt displaying the Corenix Club logo, Gym business info, randomized Receipt No, and dynamic amount values.\n   - Integrated `window.print()` when triggering the \"Print\" button. The styling ensures the receipt prints optimally while gracefully hiding the app\'s standard UI using optimized Tailwind print modifiers.\n\n5. **UI & UX Polish**:\n   - **Transitions**: Added `motion/react` fade and slide transitions as you navigate seamlessly back and forth between modules like Members, Staff, or Settings.\n   - **Data operations loading**: Check into the \"AttendanceView\" and use the \"Mark Attendance\" button\342\200\224you\'ll see a simulated loading spinner feedback state.\n   - **Interactivity Constraints**: Actions like deleting generic entries (like deleting a member) now trigger browser `window.confirm` dialogues as an additional safety measure.\n   - **Responsiveness**: Re-verified that all table components, specifically under Settings and Staff interfaces, feature CSS overflow containers (`overflow-x-auto`) for flawless horizontal scrubbing on mobile.\n   - **Mode Switch**: A dynamic \"Dark/Light Theme Toggle\" has been hooked into the topbar. Toggling it flips the visual environment between the current pristine dark mode and an accessible light variant.\n   - **Corenix Branding**: Added a subtle red glow (`bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/10`) layered dynamically behind the dashboard header to inject a slight, high-end \"premium\" aura into the primary view.\n\nThe application is thoroughly functional, responsive, compiled successfully, and ready for deployment! Feel free to review the new components."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
steps {
