 staff\nDocument fields: staffId(auto), name, phone, role, shiftStart, \nshiftEnd, salary, joinDate, status, photoURL\n\nCollection: trainers\nDocument fields: trainerId(auto), name, phone, specialization,\nexperience, salary, timing, bio, assignedMembers[], photoURL, status\n\nCollection: measurements\nDocument fields: measurementId(auto), memberId, memberName, date,\nweight, height, bodyFat, chest, waist, arms, bmi(auto-calculated)\n\nCollection: offers\nDocument fields: offerId(auto), title, description, discount,\nvalidTill, targetType, targetPlan, sentAt, sentCount, createdBy\n\nCollection: reviews\nDocument fields: reviewId(auto), memberId, memberName, rating,\nreviewText, date, reply\n\nCollection: settings\nSingle document: gymName, address, phone, whatsappNumber, \nworkingHours, logoURL, membershipPlans[]\n\nCollection: expenses (for future phase)\nCollection: leads (for future phase)\n\n=========================================================\n*/\n"
