  user_input {
    user_response: "Add a complete login system to the Corenix app before any screen is shown.\n\n1. LOGIN PAGE (shown before dashboard, full screen):\n   - Corenix logo + \"Club Software\" heading centered\n   - Dark themed card with: Email input, Password input, \"Login\" button in red\n   - \"Forgot password?\" link\n   - Do NOT show any register/signup option (staff accounts created by admin only)\n   - On wrong credentials show: \"Invalid email or password. Contact your admin.\"\n\n2. FIREBASE AUTH INTEGRATION:\n   - On Login button click: firebase.auth().signInWithEmailAndPassword(email, password)\n   - On success: hide login page, show main app\n   - On error: show error message below form\n\n3. AUTH STATE LISTENER:\n   firebase.auth().onAuthStateChanged(user => {\n     if (user) { showApp(); loadDashboardData(); }\n     else { showLoginPage(); }\n   })\n\n4. LOGOUT:\n   - Add \"Logout\" button at bottom of sidebar with user\'s name/email above it\n   - On click: firebase.auth().signOut() then reload page\n\n5. ROLE-BASED ACCESS:\n   - Store each staff member\'s role in Firestore collection \"users\":\n     Document fields: uid(same as Firebase Auth uid), name, email, role\n     Roles: \"admin\", \"receptionist\", \"trainer\"\n   - After login, fetch their role from Firestore\n   - Admin: sees everything including Settings, Reports, Staff management\n   - Receptionist: sees Members, Attendance, Offers only\n   - Trainer: sees only their assigned members and Measurements\n   - Hide sidebar nav items based on role\n\n6. ADMIN PANEL in Settings to create new staff accounts:\n   - Form: Name, Email, Password, Role dropdown\n   - Uses Firebase Admin via Cloud Function (show placeholder for now)\n   - List all staff accounts with delete option\n\nShow the full code with login page + auth system integrated."
    items {
      text: "Add a complete login system to the Corenix app before any screen is shown.\n\n1. LOGIN PAGE (shown before dashboard, full screen):\n   - Corenix logo + \"Club Software\" heading centered\n   - Dark themed card with: Email input, Password input, \"Login\" button in red\n   - \"Forgot password?\" link\n   - Do NOT show any register/signup option (staff accounts created by admin only)\n   - On wrong credentials show: \"Invalid email or password. Contact your admin.\"\n\n2. FIREBASE AUTH INTEGRATION:\n   - On Login button click: firebase.auth().signInWithEmailAndPassword(email, password)\n   - On success: hide login page, show main app\n   - On error: show error message below form\n\n3. AUTH STATE LISTENER:\n   firebase.auth().onAuthStateChanged(user => {\n     if (user) { showApp(); loadDashboardData(); }\n     else { showLoginPage(); }\n   })\n\n4. LOGOUT:\n   - Add \"Logout\" button at bottom of sidebar with user\'s name/email above it\n   - On click: firebase.auth().signOut() then reload page\n\n5. ROLE-BASED ACCESS:\n   - Store each staff member\'s role in Firestore collection \"users\":\n     Document fields: uid(same as Firebase Auth uid), name, email, role\n     Roles: \"admin\", \"receptionist\", \"trainer\"\n   - After login, fetch their role from Firestore\n   - Admin: sees everything including Settings, Reports, Staff management\n   - Receptionist: sees Members, Attendance, Offers only\n   - Trainer: sees only their assigned members and Measurements\n   - Hide sidebar nav items based on role\n\n6. ADMIN PANEL in Settings to create new staff accounts:\n   - Form: Name, Email, Password, Role dropdown\n   - Uses Firebase Admin via Cloud Function (show placeholder for now)\n   - List all staff accounts with delete option\n\nShow the full code with login page + auth system integrated."
